GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_RecallOracleFirst> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_RecallOracleFirst> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RecallOracleFirst> ;
    narr:childCount "11"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "d47e17f24a950a0d71348dc45b695a3faf9b06c6" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative holds a single-day arc on how a judged set should be built and how exhaustiveness gets proven. It opens with [a sizing pass over the dead tier and unframed statements](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_14), where the question is whether a re-extraction would fix most of the breakdown. The mainline runs through [a rejection of scoring against production's own placements](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_25) — [the objection itself, that replicating production makes no sense](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_26) — into [the replacement design: exhaustive recall, then a precision pass with picks, ambiguous ones noted, closely rejected kept, big models first with small-model judgments overlaid](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_27), stated as [the directive verbatim](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_28) and grounded in [the principle that small-model trust is by confirmation, not faith](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_29). Exhaustiveness is then pressed and answered: [the challenge over whether everything relevant is included](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_31) met by [the admission that it was not, and a complement pass added](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_32); [a low recall number is called out and the gap demanded](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_33). The measured results close it: [re-scoring at the unit of expand, with token costs per document shape](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_37) and [the full findings table — frame-index recovery, navigator, Haiku with direction, model runaways, and the judged set showing production's targets recover only a fraction of what two judges agreed was relevant](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_39).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_14> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_25> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_26> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_27> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_28> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_29> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_31> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_32> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_33> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_37> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_39> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "most of the weirdness in that breakdown sounds like a 355 re-extraction would fix almost all of it. If we fix strata and then do a full re-extraction, wouldn't that change very substantially?" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_14> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "that seems like a pretty questionable metric to be running against, right? Because isn't our entire stance here that production isn't doing it right? So saying that we're trying to replicate production doesn't make any sense to me." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_26> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "then do a precision pass over it and throw out all the things that are obviously not relevant and make picks and say why and have some ambiguous ones noted and have other ones that are closely rejected still in the list so that they can be looked at, and have this done by a couple different models … do this set with the big models and then have the small models' judgments overlaid" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_28> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "trusting the small models there is something we want to do by confirmation, not faith." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_29> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "are you sure that everything that might be relevant is being included? And what's the mechanism for that?" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_31> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "It was not; a complement pass over every unpicked frame, judged whole, was added." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_32> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "that to me is pretty bad. What are you actually missing and how do we understand what the gap between that number is and full recall?" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_33> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The pool was pressed as exhaustive and the answer was that it was not — a complement pass had to be added, so the design's own premise failed its first test." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_31> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_32> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The judged-set results undercut the reference point the whole exercise started from: production's targets recover only a small fraction of what two judges agreed was relevant, so the floor was a poor guide." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_39> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Not every shape read well — a two-person call transcript read weakly, and one model ran away uncapped and lost calls while another never hit a limit." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_39> ] ;
    narr:run "4e43ac1885e7" ;
    narr:moved "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    narr:diffBasis "first" ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:nitro" .
}